Description:
ElectroMind is het bedrijf voor alle diensten op het gebied van aandrijftechnische oplossingen. Wij bieden maatwerk en ontzorgen u volledig met de inzet van onze kennis en expertise bij de engineering, assemblage, test en inbedrijfname van panelen en besturingskasten.

Wij willen een bijdrage leveren aan het succes van onze klanten door middel van een duurzame en langjarige samenwerking, waarbij ons vakmanschap wordt gebruikt om een top kwaliteitsproduct te leveren.

ElectroMind staat voor:
- betrouwbaarheid en flexibiliteit;
- goede prijs/kwaliteit verhouding;
- integriteit en transparantie;
- een no nonsens aanpak;
- totale ontzorging;
- vakmanschap;
- topkwaliteit;
- maatwerk.

B Industrial staat voor onafhankelijk advies in de procesindustrie. Uw installatie is zo goed als de door u gekozen instrumentatie. Daarbij spelen corrigerende organen, ook wel genoemd appendages, een belangrijke rol.

B Industrial richt zich op het adviseren en ondersteunen bij regeltechnische vraagstukken, ongeacht of dit nieuwbouw, revisie of een storingsanalyse betreft.

B Industrial biedt gedegen advies door jarenlange praktijkervaring in diverse regeltechnische processen.

Diensten:
- Ventiel berekeningen;
- Project ondersteuning;
- Storings- en uitvalanalyse;
- Plant asset management.

Comaen is ontstaan vanuit een passie voor industrie, productieprocessen, het automatiseren ervan en het werken met mensen. Wij zijn een specialistisch recruitment bureau voor technisch professionals.

Ons onderscheidend vermogen zit in onze expertise en netwerk. Onze consultants hebben kennis van het vakgebied waarvoor zij verantwoordelijk zijn. In combinatie met hun ondernemerschap en persoonlijke betrokkenheid zijn zij ervaren gesprekspartners voor onze professionals. Voor onze opdrachtgevers fungeren zij als professionele adviseurs voor allerhande capaciteits- en groei vraagstukken.

Onze opdrachtgevers werken binnen de industrie, waarbij Comaen zich specifiek richt op de disciplines:

- Industrial Automation (PLC/SCADA/MES);
- Mechanical Engineering;
- Process Engineering;
- Electrical & Instrumentation.

SayField International developes, commercialises and supports Multi Body Simulation programs

The company goal of SayField International is to stimulate use of simulation programs by:

* Offering expert consultancy in modelling and simulation of complex mechanical systems using MSC.ADAMS;

* Keeping close contact with other ADAMS distributors and consultants world wide;

* Assisting in giving Multi Body Dynamics courses at Universities;

* Providing MSC.ADAMS introduction courses and advanced courses;

* Investigating new areas to apply Multi Body simulations to increase the quality of products and decrease product development time.

Hudson Cybertec is a cyber security solution provider for ICS/OT.

Hudson Cybertec helps companies to defend themselves against cyber threats in industrial automation, digital control systems and applications. Some examples of such environments are SCADA systems, Industrial Control Systems, Process Control Systems, Smart Industry, Industrial Internet of Things, and other (building bound) technical installations. Hudson Cybertec supplies specialized knowledge and services regarding cyber security and industrial networks to companies where the technical installations are essential for their business.

The main activities are developing and executing:

- Security awareness programs;
- IEC 62443 Security assessments;
 -Cyber Security Management ;
 -Security policies & procedures;
- Consultancy;
- Pentesting
- IACS forensics;
- Security Design Validation
- Security implementation;
- IACS IEC 62443 security training.

Hudson Cybertec operates frequently in accordance with de facto standard for IACS cyber security, the IEC 62443. The company is intimately involved with the development of this standard and is globally recognized as Subject Matter Expert (SME). On European level, Hudson Cybertec is involved in several EU working groups for cyber security in Critical Infrastructure.

Hudson Cybertec is primarily active in the domains that belong to the Critical Infrastructure, such as energy, oil & gas, water, nuclear and the chemical & process industry, but also operates in non-critical and other markets. The unique combination of profound domain-specific knowledge, extensive experience in cyber security and broad expertise in industrial and technical automation, distinguishes Hudson Cybertec from other security companies.

SAMSON REGELTECHNIEK is the Dutch sales agency of the international SAMSON GROUP. It was founded in 1974 and currently employs 40 people. We advise, supply and service SAMSON control valves and safety valves (SIL) for process installations in the Netherlands. As a specialist in the control of temperature, pressure, differential pressure and quantity, SAMSON offers tailor-made solutions for a wide range of applications. We are ISO 9001: 2015 and SCC* 2017/6.0 certified. In addition, we can supply 3.1 inspection certificates.

In short:
• we keep stock of original SAMSON parts in Zoetermeer;
• we have the knowledge and expertise of SAMSON equipment;
• we do the engineering of our equipment;
• we advise regarding selection and application of instrumentation;
• we help you find the best solution to instrumentation problems on site;
• we support you with commissioning your equipment;
• we translate recommended solutions into custom-made offers;
• we offer after sales solutions;
• we offer training and instruction courses.

SAMSON GROUP
The SAMSON GROUP is comprised of SAMSON AG (head office in Frankfurt am Main, Germany), 200 global SAMSON sales agencies, 40 subsidiaries and 10 production sites. SAMSON operates wherever there is controlled flow of oils, gases, vapors or chemical substances. Valves are our core business, but the SAM DIGITAL product line has been added for smart networking of components and systems in process automation.

Stay up to date!
If you are interested in current news from our company, please visit our website (https://netherlands.samsongroup.com/) and/or follow our company page on LinkedIn.

